{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tom's Hat Shoppe increased all original prices by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />.  Now the shoppe is having a sale where all prices are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off these increased prices.  Which statement best describes the sale price of an item?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9c7b2a1967dfecf5d8d4b03be05e6a6c4e6c03a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{The sale price is }5\\% \\text{ higher than the original price.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"401\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/5/c3569493991679ccac7a6aa6792567c782479eba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)}\\ \\text{The sale price is higher than the original price, but by less than }5\\% .$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"528\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/1/b01610d71fba48d5d24711125fa030f2d767857f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)}\\ \\text{The sale price is higher than the original price, but by more than }5\\% .$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"539\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5e8c0c1706782e251ec6365c1fa43a77d721d48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)}\\ \\text{The sale price is lower than the original price.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"364\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/4/ae4f4fbf53cd62428f7e574a2699dab1453e1647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)}\\ \\text{The sale price is the same as the original price.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"374\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the original price of the item.  The shoppe originally increased this to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659ea026f238eb026d79c0605eff5b2a20c01900.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.25x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.  The sale brings it down to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/3485b7dcd01042b6b259eed6d97da35531e1f7eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0.8)(1.25x)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f84276ab4890f83659c0bc8910e10ecfda23413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{The sale price is the same as the original price.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"389\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose the original price of an item was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />.  The shoppe originally increased the price to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb7a7738e4c0bb3bca6566d1ca365af32643f514.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.25 \\cdot \\$100 = \\$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"144\" height=\"16\" />, while the sale reduced it to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/f/1bf7eb705a01b220beb5617c76e614a4687b0a76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8 \\cdot \\$125 = \\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f84276ab4890f83659c0bc8910e10ecfda23413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{The sale price is the same as the original price.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"389\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/